{"hw":"πειράζω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">πειράζω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">πειράζω</span>, (<span class=\"lex-etym gk\">πεῖρα</span>) used by early authors only in <span class=\"lex-gram\">pres.</span> and <span class=\"lex-gram\">impf.</span>, the other tenses being supplied by <span class=\"gk\">πειράω, -άομαι</span>: Cret. <span class=\"lex-gram\">fut.</span> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <span class=\"gk\">πειράξω</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">GDI</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5181</span> </span>: <span class=\"lex-gram\">aor. 1</span> imper. <span class=\"gk\">πείρασον</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">AP</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">11.183</span> </span> (<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Lucill.</span> </span>): <span class=\"lex-gram\">aor.</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Pass.</span> </span> <span class=\"gk\">ἐπειράσθην</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">LXX</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Wi.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">11.9</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ev.Matt.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.1</span> </span>: <span class=\"lex-gram\">pf.</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\">part.</span> <span class=\"gk\">πεπειρασμένος</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ep.Hebr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.15</span> </span>:—<b class=\"lex-tr\">make proof</b> or <b class=\"lex-tr\">trial of</b>, c. gen., <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Od.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">16.319.23.114</span> </span>: abs., <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">9.281</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> c. <span class=\"lex-gram\">inf.</spa