-cite-scope\">32</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> c. acc. pers., <b class=\"lex-tr\">try, tempt</b> a person, <b class=\"lex-tr\">put</b> him <b class=\"lex-tr\">to the test</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">LXX</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ge.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">22.1</span> </span>, al.; <span class=\"gk\">ἑαυτοὺς πειράζετε, εἰ</span>.. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">2 Ep.Cor.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">13.5</span> </span>, al.; <span class=\"gk\">τί πειράζετε τὸν Κύριον</span>; <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">LXX</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ex.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">17.2</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Act.Ap.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">15.10</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">1 Ep.Cor.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">10.9</span> </span>, al. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> in bad sense, <b class=\"lex-tr\">seek to seduce, tempt</b>, <span class=\"gk\">Ἀθηναίην</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.R.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.10</span> </span>: abs., <span class=\"gk\">ὁ πειράζων</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">the Tempter</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">1 Ep.Thess.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.5</span> </span>, etc.:—<span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Pass.</span> </span>, <b class=\"lex-tr\">to be sorely tried</b>, <span class=\"gk\">πειραζομένη βασανίζομαι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">PLit.Lond.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">52.5</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">στομακάκκῃ</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Str.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-